spans.s:
सम्-√ बन्ध् P. -बध्नाति, to bind or fasten or tie together, bind or fix on, attach, connect, join, construct, form, ŚBr. &c. &c.;
to procure, furnish, supply, Ragh. :
Pass. -बध्यते, to be bound or fastened together &c.;
to be connected with or supplied, belong to, Kāś. on Pāṇ. i, 4, 51 &c. :
Caus. -बन्धयति, to cause to bind or be bound together &c., R.;
to cause to connect with or refer to (instr.), Kull. on Mn. v, 85.

सम्-√ बाध् Ā. -बाधते, to press together, compress, press down, AV.;
to bind firmly together, ŚāṅkhŚr.;
to oppress, afflict, torment, R.

सम्-√ बुध् Ā. -बुध्यते (pr. p. -बुध्यमान, q.v.), to wake up, MBh.; R.;
to perceive or understand thoroughly, notice, observe, know, ib. &c.:
Caus. -बोधयति, to cause to wake up, rouse, R.;
to cause to know, inform, advise, instruct;
 teach (two acc.), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to call to, MBh., Kāś. on Pāṇ. i, 2, 33;
to cause to agree, MW. :
Desid. of Caus. See सम्-बुबोधयिषु.

सम्-√ 2. बृह् (or बृंह्) P. -बृहति (pf. -बबर्ह), to join firmly, AV.; ŚBr. :
Caus. -बर्हयति, to join or unite with (dat.), RV.;
 -बृंहयति, to strengthen, refresh, encourage, MBh.

सम्-√ 2. बृह् (or बृंह्) P. -बृहति (pf. -बबर्ह), to join firmly, AV.; ŚBr. :
Caus. -बर्हयति, to join or unite with (dat.), RV.;
 -बृंहयति, to strengthen, refresh, encourage, MBh.

सम्-√ ब्रू P. Ā. -ब्रवीति, -ब्रूते, to speak well, converse, RV.;
 (Ā.) to talk together, agree, ib.;
to say anything to (acc.), MBh.
